+#### New `is_pre_gloas_slot`
+
+```python
+def is_pre_gloas_slot(state: BeaconState, slot: Slot) -> bool:
+    """
+    Check if ``slot`` precedes the Gloas fork.
+    """
+    if state.fork.current_version != GLOAS_FORK_VERSION:
+        return False
+    return compute_epoch_at_slot(slot) < state.fork.epoch
+```
+
